  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Employment and Enterprise Development Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Tajikistan Employment and Enterprise Development Activity (EEDA) is a five-year, $18M program funded by USAID and implemented by ACDI/VOCA. Using an inclusive market systems (IMS) approach, EEDA will increase market-led sales and inclusive sustainable jobs and livelihoods for Tajikistan households through the improved ability of Tajikistan businesses to produce better quality and more consistent volumes of competitively priced goods and services.</narrative>
  </description>
